    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e356592583967a9105b961",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我再次明白了，\n大家就像奇锐骏那样，以顶点为目标……\n果敢挑战着──",
      "source_fingerprint": "24165b3c30264f9b751a3539ddc87683d1a801e0d11d0b9e843acce986ac5ea3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099101.json",
      "json_path": [
